# Quickstart's run output is NOT a tested gallery (the e2e regenerates it in a tmp dir), so its
# per-run report must not be committed as canonical. The groundedness/judge-calibration example
# reports ARE a tested gallery (tests/plugin/test_examples_gallery.py) and stay tracked. (P3-B)
examples/quickstart/evals/reports/*/
